{
  "_comment": "One entry per benchmarked model. 'backend' picks the provider: openrouter / huggingface (openai-compatible) or local (llamacpp-jni, GGUF under modelDir). 'settings' are copied verbatim into the srcMorph aiDefinition; the common settings below apply first. 'origin' marks the June 2026 benchmark models.",
  "common": {
    "maxOutputTokens": 4096,
    "temperature": 0.2
  },
